# packages/sdk

- Zod schemas used by both the api and the apps. `formatMoney`, `toMinor`, `fromMinor`, `pick`, `imageSrc`, `slugify`.
- `proxy.ts`: `createProxy(allowed)` and the `WEB_ALLOWED` / `DASHBOARD_ALLOWED` lists. Adding a path here widens what a
  browser origin can reach: think before you do.
- REST GET query strings are text, so numeric GET inputs only work over RPC (the apps use RPC).
